  "sentences": [
    "The agent can only touch these assets: CNY.",
    "It can only call: instruct. Approvals and any other function are refused.",
    "It can never send the native coin.",
    "It can never call your own account or 8 protocol contracts (DelegationManager, EntryPoint, PayeeBook, MandateRegistry, KillSwitchRegistry, YinglongPassportRegistry, AccountabilityLedger and ProductRegistry).",
    "Everything stops the moment you press Pause, your guardian pauses, or the supervisor halts this agent.",
    "Only agents whose passport is bound to your identity can use this mandate.",
    "It works only while mandate 0x902dada3... is live in the public mandate registry.",
    "Jurisdiction: Mainland China (coin-free rail). Rails allowed: CNY.",
    "Money goes only to payees in your payee book or to agents attested by Harbour Digital Bank.",
    "Payments above 50,000 CNY need your approval on your phone (except payroll up to 120,000 CNY); anyone new above 1,000 CNY also needs you; nothing above 200,000 CNY is possible at all.",
    "Every 30 days: supplier at most 300,000 CNY, payroll at most 120,000 CNY and services at most 5,000 CNY.",
    "Your CNY balance never goes below 100,000 CNY.",
    "At most 6 payments and 250,000 CNY per day."
  ],
